[3G…'`[7G|
[3G|[5Gstring[12Gnot[16Gin[19G`ALLOWED_CURRENCIES`[40G|[42G`'currency[53G"XYZ"[59Gis[62Gnot[66Ga[68Gsupported
[3GISO-4217[12Gcode'`[19G|

[3G**Example**

